<section class="section wrap" aria-labelledby="downloads-title"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Ready for different contexts</p><h2 id="downloads-title">One identity.<br>Plenty of possibilities.</h2><p>Vector files scale cleanly. Transparent PNG and WebP files are ready for everyday use. Opaque JPG files work well for social uploads.</p></div><div class="asset-grid">{% for asset in logoAssets %}<article class="asset-card"><div class="asset-preview {{ asset.previewClass }}"><img src="/images/logo/{{ asset.slug }}.svg" alt="{{ asset.name }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ asset.width }}" height="{{ asset.height }}"></div><div class="asset-info"><h3>{{ asset.name }}</h3><p>{{ asset.description }}</p><div class="download-links">{% for format in asset.formats %}<a href="/images/logo/{{ asset.slug }}.{{ format }}" download aria-label="Download {{ asset.name }} as {{ format | upper }}">{{ format | upper }} <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></article>{% endfor %}</div></section>
<section class="section soft-section"><div class="wrap split-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little guidance</p><h2>Keep it clear.<br>Give it room.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Leave at least one stem-width of clear space around the symbol. Use the symbol at 24 pixels or larger, and the horizontal wordmark at 140 pixels or larger.</p><p>Use blue or black on light backgrounds, and white on dark backgrounds. Keep the original proportions. Avoid shadows, outlines, gradients, rotation, or placing the mark on a busy image.</p><div class="palette"><span><i style="--swatch: #2458e6"></i>Access blue <code>#2458E6</code></span><span><i style="--swatch: #162c32"></i>Deep ink <code>#162C32</code></span><span><i style="--swatch: #f7f8f2"></i>Warm white <code>#F7F8F2</code></span></div><p><a href="/images/logo/usage.txt" download>Download usage notes</a> · <a href="/images/logo/favicon.ico" download>Download favicon ICO</a> · <a href="/images/logo/apple-touch-icon.png" download>Download Apple touch icon</a></p><p class="small-note">The logo identifies Hipercare. Its use must not imply a partnership, clinical certification, or endorsement that has not been agreed.</p></div></div></section>
